## SQ-EDL-03 | void pepper half: spreads then fruits; fruiting sprout drops 3, plain sprout 1 (soils / growth passed in r1102b s3)
@group A
@commands Place the 4 plants on end stone, tilled end stone, dirt, farmland (EDL-03); random tick speed 100 on both soils (EDL-04, EDL-05)
@pass Only the two soils; faster on tilled; void pepper spreads then fruits, 3 / 1 drops
@fails
@from batches/r1103/p2_R.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# no bot here any more (randomtick needs no player), so the lane is forceloaded instead
> forceload add 320 520 334 534
sleep 2
> fill 320 -61 520 334 -61 534 minecraft:end_stone
> fill 320 -60 520 334 -57 534 minecraft:air
> setblock 327 -60 527 endersdelight:voidpepper_block[down=true,spreading=true,pepper=false]
# 30 random ticks per block = the old 20 s at tick speed 300 near a bot (randomtick needs no player)
> cdevtest randomtick 320 -60 520 334 -57 534 30
> cdevtest count 320 -60 520 334 -57 534 endersdelight:voidpepper_block
expect verb=count block=endersdelight:voidpepper_block n=([2-9]|\d\d)\b
> execute if block 327 -60 527 endersdelight:voidpepper_block[spreading=false,pepper=true] run say EN03 origin fruited
> execute if block 327 -60 527 endersdelight:voidpepper_block[spreading=true] run say EN03 origin still spreading
> fill 320 -60 520 334 -57 534 minecraft:air
> setblock 322 -60 522 endersdelight:voidpepper_block[down=true,spreading=false,pepper=true]
> cdevtest break 322 -60 522
> setblock 324 -60 522 endersdelight:voidpepper_block[down=true,spreading=false,pepper=false]
> cdevtest break 324 -60 522
expect verb=break who=\S+ broken=true before="?endersdelight:voidpepper_block\S* after=minecraft:air
expect verb=break drops=endersdelight:voidpepper:3 stacks=\d+\b
expect verb=break drops=endersdelight:voidpepper:1 stacks=1\b
> forceload remove 320 520 334 534
look the spread count (more than one sprout after 30 random ticks per block, about 20 s at tick speed 300) and the origin line ("fruited" once spreading ends; "still spreading" is not a fail by itself)
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ .*error=

